{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 3, "text": "借助宗教力量的一例。", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 338, "w": 390, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "借助宗教力量的一例。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 338, "w": 390, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 4, "text": "其四，习惯法与国家成文法互为补充。由布依族文化二元复合特性决定布依族习惯", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 398, "w": 1467, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "其四，习惯法与国家成文法互为补充。由布依族文化二元复合特性决定布依族习惯", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 398, "w": 1467, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 5, "text": "法往往与国家成文法互为补充，在布依族社会生活中发挥作用。这种补充主要表现在两", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 463, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "法往往与国家成文法互为补充，在布依族社会生活中发挥作用。这种补充主要表现在两", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 463, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 6, "text": "个方面：一是习惯法和国家成文法同时发挥作用。例如在婚姻方面，既执行国家婚姻法", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 527, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "个方面：一是习惯法和国家成文法同时发挥作用。例如在婚姻方面，既执行国家婚姻法", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 527, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 7, "text": "有关规定，同时也继承本民族习惯法传统（如通婚范围、婚姻缔结方式等）。另一方面，国", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 591, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有关规定，同时也继承本民族习惯法传统（如通婚范围、婚姻缔结方式等）。另一方面，国", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 591, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 8, "text": "家成文法和本民族习惯法在不同的方面发挥作用。例如对重大刑事案件的处罚，一般由", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 656, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "家成文法和本民族习惯法在不同的方面发挥作用。例如对重大刑事案件的处罚，一般由", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 656, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 9, "text": "国家成文法施行；对一般的民事纠纷和一般刑事案件，则首先采用本民族习惯法处理，若", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 720, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "国家成文法施行；对一般的民事纠纷和一般刑事案件，则首先采用本民族习惯法处理，若", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 720, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 10, "text": "难以处理才移交国家成文法裁决。", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 793, "w": 595, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "难以处理才移交国家成文法裁决。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 793, "w": 595, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 11, "text": "（三）布依族生产及分配习惯法", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 857, "w": 563, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "（三）布依族生产及分配习惯法", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 857, "w": 563, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 12, "text": "1. 生产习惯法", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 921, "w": 261, "h": 45}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "1. 生产习惯法", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 921, "w": 261, "h": 45}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 13, "text": "生产方面的习惯法是指有关生产领域及其过程中的一些规约。这些规约有些是刻", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 986, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "生产方面的习惯法是指有关生产领域及其过程中的一些规约。这些规约有些是刻", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 986, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 14, "text": "在乡规碑上，有些则通过口耳相传的形式承传。", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1050, "w": 820, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在乡规碑上，有些则通过口耳相传的形式承传。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1050, "w": 820, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 15, "text": "通过口耳相传的形式承传的习惯法因历史悠久，已成为人们自觉的行准则，例如", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1114, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "通过口耳相传的形式承传的习惯法因历史悠久，已成为人们自觉的行准则，例如", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1114, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 16, "text": "在很多地区，人们在平整水田播撒稻种后，在田中插上若干小树枝作为标志。这个标志", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1179, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在很多地区，人们在平整水田播撒稻种后，在田中插上若干小树枝作为标志。这个标志", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1179, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 17, "text": "的警示含义是：此田已播撒谷种，严禁牛马、鹅鸭践踏。人们看到这种标志，都自觉遵守。", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1243, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的警示含义是：此田已播撒谷种，严禁牛马、鹅鸭践踏。人们看到这种标志，都自觉遵守。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1243, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 18, "text": "若自己饲养的牲口因看管不严践踏了别人的秧田，都能自觉向田主人赔偿。又如农忙时", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1304, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "若自己饲养的牲口因看管不严践踏了别人的秧田，都能自觉向田主人赔偿。又如农忙时", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1304, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 19, "text": "的换工，也没有明文规定，但人们习惯形成了这种规约。这种换工不要求同等工时互换，", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1372, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的换工，也没有明文规定，但人们习惯形成了这种规约。这种换工不要求同等工时互换，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1372, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 20, "text": "但也应大致相当。举例说，甲某在插秧时因人手不够，请乙某帮忙插了一天秧。过不久，", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1440, "w": 1548, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "但也应大致相当。举例说，甲某在插秧时因人手不够，请乙某帮忙插了一天秧。过不久，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1440, "w": 1548, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 21, "text": "乙某修建房屋连续请甲某帮忙三天，甲某也不会因吃亏而拒绝。但如果下次甲某有事请", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1505, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "乙某修建房屋连续请甲某帮忙三天，甲某也不会因吃亏而拒绝。但如果下次甲某有事请", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1505, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 22, "text": "乙某帮忙，而乙某借故不答应，那么社会舆论就会谴责乙某，使其在今后有事需请人时无", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1565, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "乙某帮忙，而乙某借故不答应，那么社会舆论就会谴责乙某，使其在今后有事需请人时无", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1565, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 23, "text": "人答应。这种惩罚是相当重的。", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1633, "w": 555, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "人答应。这种惩罚是相当重的。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1633, "w": 555, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 24, "text": "在平塘县上莫乡，猎人之间对各自狩猎区域有一个不成文的约定：狩猎户按狩猎方", "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 1698, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在平塘县上莫乡，猎人之间对各自狩猎区域有一个不成文的约定：狩猎户按狩猎方", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 1698, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 25, "text": "法和捕猎对象不同，分为“上硐煤山”猎人、“中硐煤山”猎人和“下硐煤山”猎人三种。", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1754, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "法和捕猎对象不同，分为“上硐煤山”猎人、“中硐煤山”猎人和“下硐煤山”猎人三种。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1754, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 26, "text": "“上硐煤山”专猎虎、豹等凶猛野兽，“中硐煤山”专打野猪、野羊等中等动物，“下硐煤山”", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1823, "w": 1552, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“上硐煤山”专猎虎、豹等凶猛野兽，“中硐煤山”专打野猪、野羊等中等动物，“下硐煤山”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1823, "w": 1552, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 27, "text": "则专打山羊、野兔和野鸡等较小的动物。各“硐”之间对这种划分都必须自觉遵守。", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1887, "w": 1439, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "则专打山羊、野兔和野鸡等较小的动物。各“硐”之间对这种划分都必须自觉遵守。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1887, "w": 1439, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 28, "text": "生产资料方面，也有相应的习惯法。例如，清代布依族地区土地主要分为“粮田”、", "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 1951, "w": 1463, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "生产资料方面，也有相应的习惯法。例如，清代布依族地区土地主要分为“粮田”、", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 1951, "w": 1463, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 29, "text": "“印田”、“把事田”和“私田”几种。", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 2016, "w": 599, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“印田”、“把事田”和“私田”几种。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 2016, "w": 599, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 30, "text": "“粮田”即封建领主占有的田。领主把土地分给农民耕种，耕种“粮田”的人家可世代", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 2080, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“粮田”即封建领主占有的田。领主把土地分给农民耕种，耕种“粮田”的人家可世代", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 2080, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 31, "text": "耕种，享有长期使用权，但无所有权，封建领主也不能随意收回再转给别户耕种。绝嗣户", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2144, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "耕种，享有长期使用权，但无所有权，封建领主也不能随意收回再转给别户耕种。绝嗣户", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2144, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 32, "text": "可由领主分给别家耕种。", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2213, "w": 434, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "可由领主分给别家耕种。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2213, "w": 434, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 33, "text": "“印田”和“把事田”又称“俸禄田”，是领主将其领地内最好的大坝水田划出一部分，", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 2273, "w": 1467, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“印田”和“把事田”又称“俸禄田”，是领主将其领地内最好的大坝水田划出一部分，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 2273, "w": 1467, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 34, "text": "作养膳之用。“印田”归领主所有，可以世袭，不能出卖。“把事田”不能世袭，一旦去职，", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2338, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "作养膳之用。“印田”归领主所有，可以世袭，不能出卖。“把事田”不能世袭，一旦去职，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2338, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 35, "text": "领主即把田收回。", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2410, "w": 310, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "领主即把田收回。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2410, "w": 310, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 36, "text": "“私田”指农户在“粮田”之外自己开垦的田。这些“私田”不负担土司或王朝的税", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 2460, "w": 1464, "h": 69}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“私田”指农户在“粮田”之外自己开垦的田。这些“私田”不负担土司或王朝的税", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 2460, "w": 1464, "h": 69}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 284, "line_no": 37, "text": "赋，谁开垦就属于谁。这类田可以抵押和买卖，可以世代继承和转赠，外人无权干涉。", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2539, "w": 1471, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "赋，谁开垦就属于谁。这类田可以抵押和买卖，可以世代继承和转赠，外人无权干涉。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2539, "w": 1471, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
